## W0003 -- a function of the program has the same name as one in an imported module (the program's wins, silently otherwise).
## command: lume build   (this file shows the diagnostic: the gate runs a copy named .src; W0003_duplicate_name.fixed.src is the corrected program)
## fix: rename it, or mark it `priv fn` to say the program's own version is meant
use seq
fn seq_sum(xs) = 0
fn test_sum() = seq_sum([1, 2]) == 0
